  "question": "Business Requirements Description:\nParking Management System:\n1.When a vehicle enters the parking lot, the system queries available parking spaces and assigns the vehicle to an empty spot. If there are no available spots, the system returns null.\n2.When a vehicle leaves the parking lot, the system marks the parking spot used by the vehicle as empty.\nSupplementary Information:\nThe parking space table records the status of each parking space (whether it is occupied or not).\nThe entry table records the status of each entry point (whether a vehicle has entered).\nThe exit table records the status of each exit point (whether a vehicle has left).",
  "ddl": "-- Schema for database: rschema_0455\nCREATE TABLE `parking_spaces` (\n  `id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `status` tinyint(1) NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`id`),\n  ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `entries` (\n  `id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `parking_space_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `entry_time` datetime NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`id`),\n  KEY `entries_ibfk_1` (`parking_space_id`),\n  CONSTRAINT `entries_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`parking_space_id`) REFERENCES `parking_spaces` (`id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE,\n  ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `exits` (\n  `id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `parking_space_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `exit_time` datetime NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`id`),\n  KEY `exits_ibfk_1` (`parking_space_id`),\n  CONSTRAINT `exits_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`parking_space_id`) REFERENCES `parking_spaces` (`id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE,\n  ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;",
